            <https://w3id.org/morpholib/thompson/portfolio/multiclade-preregistration-manifest-2026-10-23-leporidae_skulls>,
            <https://w3id.org/morpholib/thompson/portfolio/multiclade-preregistration-manifest-2026-10-23-morpho_butterflies>,
            <https://w3id.org/morpholib/thompson/portfolio/multiclade-preregistration-manifest-2026-10-23-pheidole_ants>,
